# AFA Fillies Website

## Overview

AFA Fillies is a modern football website designed for a girls' soccer organization. The website focuses on showcasing the club's legacy, achievements, players, upcoming matches, and opportunities for girls to develop their football skills.

## Key Features

* Modern football-focused visual design
* Responsive layout for desktop and mobile devices
* Hero section with strong branding and call-to-action
* About section introducing the AFA Fillies organization
* Club championship and achievement showcase
* Team and player-focused content
* Elite coaching and player development information
* Girls-focused football program highlights
* Upcoming matches and game schedule
* Strong call-to-action sections for joining the club
* Footer with navigation, contact details, and additional information

## Design

The website uses a dark sports-inspired theme with teal and white as the primary colors. Large photography, angled image treatments, bold typography, geometric backgrounds, and high-contrast sections create an energetic football atmosphere.

